# Testing

- Prefer table-driven unit tests next to the package (`foo_test.go`)
- Guard/proxy/status-code changes: cover happy path + fail-closed paths
- Offline e2e lives in `test/` with fixtures in `testdata/` — no real Turso/Redis
- Do not hit live providers in automated tests; use `httptest` mocks
- After behavior changes, keep assertions aligned with `docs/API.md` status codes

```powershell
go test ./...
go test ./test/... -count=1
```

Skip flaky sleeps/network in unit tests; keep e2e deterministic and offline.
